    "# Question 5 :\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Part (a): EDA\n",
    "# Display basic info and analyze relationships\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:**\n",
    "\n",
    "1. In this question, the linear regression algorithm will be implemented manually without using any libraries. A simple dataset consisting of two independent variables \"Age\" and \"Experience\" and one dependent variable \"Income\" has been provided. The dataset is located at \"Datasets.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "   **a) EDA (Exploratory Data Analysis):** Read the data and examine the relationship between the two existing features and the output feature.\n",
    "\n",
    "   **b) Data Processing:** Investigate normalization and standardization techniques and apply one of them based on the information obtained regarding normalization to the data manually.\n",
    "\n",
    "   **c) Implement linear regression using the gradient descent method to calculate the Mean Squared Error (MSE) and report the results.**\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Implement linear regression using the normal equations and report the results, comparing them with the previous part's results.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "If you need help with any specific part of this question, feel free to ask!"
   ]
